4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AXeymtkgXjsQ7kNvwGDjmPE&_nc_oc=AdrfwZq7V9wzJEPgXXV3lfztyngES6wLiMh1Ss3fypFGVjzE7SHhN2Bqs1_vace3muQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHph5El0ybqsFaVveJC4VoyXhv4D5HSne_WNQniG1BGPw&oe=6A884CD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t7wrqvA2-W4Q7kNvwHh3Smq&_nc_oc=Adp_0JYgUA5a1rHeUkVgTju96iO8BwUkeex_XtwLEbW0hedI-NG_u2bO-4On1c_trh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLrap9tGcLEf8c_2cPaDRtdmcICN4mon15tqxr5J_iRw&oe=6A8851B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xl2Up4ZQOfIQ7kNvwEvC8gp&_nc_oc=AdoSMc0px9fesn363ZG8eM43hGeG-yru32zLZjYsQbnWDH4H9s88-anjd7pRHZAdmGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFPsMqgkXjLv-8htrKPvve7O9GluBnljFNWJAU0yGG0NQ&oe=6A882715"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p